 "summary": "The RT2 is a monostable two-pole through-hole PCB relay with either two changeover or two make contacts rated 8 A at 250 VAC (10 A under UL), switching up to 400 VAC and 2000 VA. Coils come in 5 to 110 VDC at about 400 mW or 24 to 230 VAC at about 0.75 VA. Coil and contacts are separated by 5 kV reinforced insulation with 10 mm clearance and creepage. RT424024 is the flux-proof, two-changeover, AgNi 90/10 version with a 24 VDC, 1440 Ω coil, rated for -40 to 85 °C ambient.",
